	<meta property="og:description" content="PLANO, Texas (September 2, 2020) – What happens when Toyota designers blend sport coupe, hatchback and compact crossover? The boldly expressive, fun to drive and utterly unique C-HR happens. The C-HR’s standout design for 2021 is just as edgy – with the [&hellip;]" />
